   "Definitions": {
    "value": "<ul><li>to carry, to bear (a burden)</li><li>(of wind, water, etc.) to carry along, to drive</li><li>to have something (e.g. a name, sideburns, a gun...)</li><li>to wear (clothes, shoes or makeup)<br></li></ul>",
    "order": 4
   },
   "Examples": {
    "value": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Examples:</strong></p><ul><li><em>но обуваться в простую обувь и не носить двух одежд.</em> - But wear simple footwear and do not carry two sets of clothing.</li></ul>",
